  "mechanism": "sys_timer_create (SIGEV_SIGNAL and SIGEV_THREAD_ID arms) and sys_pidfd_send_signal call `SigNum::try_from(signo as u8)`, so an out-of-range signal number such as 256 + SIGUSR1 wraps to a valid signal and is accepted instead of failing with EINVAL.",
  "sites": [
