  "contract": "timer_create(2) and pidfd_send_signal(2): an invalid signal number fails with EINVAL, and 256 + SIGUSR1 is not a valid signal number.",
  "observed": "By source reading at the pin (not run): both calls accept 266 as SIGUSR1.",
